		"description": "<p>A long-ranged form of military plasma weapon, these guns propel an intense bolt of high-energy plasma along an ionized path, or “beam,” allowing them to strike distant targets effectively without the plasma dispersing. These weapons were used for destroying armored targets such as combat mechs and vehicles.</p><p>The profile for the Plasma Beamer can be found in the Military Weapons Table at the start of this section. A Plasma Beamer is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Bed rest.</p>",
